; ===== sketch =====
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:13.13,Generic,Announce,0,0,0,,Sketch: "If the manager's no good, neither is the part-timer"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:18.26,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:22.49,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,One moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:26.40,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:29.51,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Hey, so the other day—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:31.15,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,That was so much fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:32.66,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Where was it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.18,0:00:35.47,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Come on, that place, that place!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:36.44,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,The maid cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:38.66,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,I've wanted to go, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.80,0:00:40.61,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:43.18,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Yuuna, do you do moe-moe kyun and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.78,0:00:44.38,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Um—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:46.62,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,I'm the one who does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.82,0:00:49.01,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Quit chatting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.08,0:00:49.95,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Go take their order.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.02,0:00:51.70,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,I can't pay your wages, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.51,0:00:55.14,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.21,0:00:57.58,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,You're the one who should get it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.65,0:01:00.07,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.67,0:01:01.35,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Anyway—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.91,0:01:04.56,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Table three is calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.63,0:01:05.80,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.87,0:01:06.90,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.97,0:01:08.21,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:11.69,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,The manager is seriously not sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.61,0:01:14.93,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,That's why we just get found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.51,0:01:16.11,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Um—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:17.51,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,Is the manager here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.23,0:01:19.15,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Manager? Manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.03,0:01:21.92,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.99,0:01:23.22,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.29,0:01:24.12,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.19,0:01:25.82,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,I'm the manager, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.89,0:01:26.82,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,You're the manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.89,0:01:27.79,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:30.96,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,Um, there was a foreign object in my food.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.62,0:01:32.81,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,A foreign object?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:33.68,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.81,0:01:36.03,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Dago — so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.19,0:01:38.80,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,Hold on — what is 'dago'?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.87,0:01:39.95,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Dago — so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.53,0:01:43.27,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,No, no — that didn't sound like there was any feeling in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:45.93,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,So what happened with the foreign object?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.49,0:01:49.38,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,In the apple-flavored tonkotsu ramen,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.45,0:01:51.34,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,there was a Kumamon in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.41,0:01:52.01,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:54.69,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,Kumamon… in apple-flavored tonkotsu ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:55.36,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Kumamon…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.43,0:01:56.19,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,You'd notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.39,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Dago — so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.46,0:01:59.48,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,No, no, no — it's not about 'dago'!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:01.43,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,Kumamon is actually huge, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.50,0:02:02.10,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:03.85,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Wait — the Kumamon next to us is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:04.76,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,I can't eat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:07.05,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,And it's way too cute — Kumamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:08.14,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:09.78,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Ugh, what now…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.22,0:02:12.34,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Ugh, maybe we just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.14,0:02:15.72,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Ooh — that's more of a last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:19.10,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Then we just have to apologize honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:21.20,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Nooo, I don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:23.18,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Not on purpose — Kumamon wandered off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:26.11,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Ugh, what do we do…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.03,0:02:28.46,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Please wait here a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.53,0:02:29.13,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.08,0:02:33.74,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Um — who put Kumamon in the apple-flavored tonkotsu ramen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.98,0:02:34.66,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:38.18,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Selling them out already?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:41.11,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,You just said Kumamon disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:44.02,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,And that you'd 'just do it' in a big way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:46.53,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Did you do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:47.75,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.21,0:02:48.81,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ah—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.93,0:02:49.56,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.63,0:02:50.78,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Even without doing that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.85,0:02:54.58,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,if you apologize, most things get forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:56.56,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Hey — we can hear you! We can hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:58.78,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Then let's go apologize now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.85,0:02:59.45,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:01.16,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,We could hear that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.23,0:03:03.39,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Alright — I've brought them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.46,0:03:06.35,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,So you're the one who put Kumamon in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:09.93,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,I didn't put it in… but it was in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:11.18,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,It gets in on its own?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:14.43,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Dear customer, on this occasion—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:15.71,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Dago…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.78,0:03:19.32,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,Are you even apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.48,0:03:20.64,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,Any feeling in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:21.36,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:24.21,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,On this occasion — dago, so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:26.57,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,No, no — that's way too stiff!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:27.31,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,That's weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:28.75,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Like this — dago, so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.82,0:03:29.42,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Dago sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.36,0:03:31.77,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone, gather up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:35.84,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,A shop like this is gonna go under.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.91,0:03:36.68,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,We're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.75,0:03:38.02,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Big reflection meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.09,0:03:41.60,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,I want a Kumamoto gourmet tour as our big reflection!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.67,0:03:42.27,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Um—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.77,0:03:44.58,Generic,Announce,0,0,0,,And with that — the shop is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.65,0:03:45.92,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,No — that doesn't make sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.99,0:03:47.68,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,What? What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:48.95,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:50.55,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,What's with that—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:52.22,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Isn't this shop insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.34,0:03:54.71,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Seriously, 'dago' makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:55.92,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.03,0:03:59.98,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,But at times like this, let's watch that show over there and get hyped!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.05,0:04:00.65,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.41,0:04:02.01,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:02.68,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:03.35,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,This, this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.42,0:04:05.83,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Everyone ready to get hyped?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:09.21,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Let's get hyped!


; ===== photo =====
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.73,0:23:23.77,Generic,Announce,0,0,60,,Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.37,0:23:26.41,Generic,Announce,0,0,60,,We're HKT48!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.18,0:23:35.94,Generic,Announce,0,0,60,,HKT48 Himawarigumi — the Saka Agari show has begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.83,0:23:40.94,Generic,Announce,0,0,60,,To start things off…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.01,0:23:43.32,Generic,Announce,0,0,60,,Te no Hira, Saka Agari, Hitei no Requiem,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.39,0:23:46.54,Generic,Announce,0,0,60,,and Sono Ase wa Uso wo Tsukanai — four songs in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.61,0:23:49.00,Generic,Announce,0,0,60,,Next, we'd like to take some commemorative photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.07,0:23:50.33,Generic,Generic,0,0,60,,Okay~
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.92,0:23:57.16,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,All right — Yuina.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.64,0:24:03.11,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,It's Mother's Day, so give us a mom pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.18,0:24:04.27,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,A mom pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.34,0:24:06.18,Generic,Generic,0,0,60,,A mom pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.60,0:24:07.15,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.57,0:24:25.49,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Okay — Fujikoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.31,0:24:27.39,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Okay, peace signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.45,0:24:29.85,Generic,Fujikoko,0,0,60,,Shouldn't have gotten picked…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.51,0:24:31.31,Generic,Fujikoko,0,0,60,,Worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.13,0:24:38.68,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.53,0:24:41.04,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,We've got one more shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.11,0:24:41.73,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.97,0:24:44.87,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,So for today's one…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.29,0:24:48.06,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Yuuna's hair kinda looked like she cut it, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.13,0:24:50.42,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Strike a fresh-haircut pose, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.49,0:24:51.43,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Didn't cut it…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.63,0:24:53.99,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,I didn't cut it…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.39,0:24:55.59,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,What even is that pose?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.45,0:24:58.03,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Like this — please and thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.43,0:25:01.05,Generic,Fujikoko,0,0,60,,Shouldn't have gotten picked…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.33,0:25:09.88,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.45,0:25:13.78,Generic,Announce,0,0,60,,The photos we just took
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.85,0:25:16.40,Generic,Announce,0,0,60,,will be on sale in the lobby after the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.47,0:25:18.42,Generic,Announce,0,0,60,,for a keepsake of today, please stop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.49,0:25:19.37,Generic,Announce,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.31,0:25:20.95,Generic,Generic,0,0,60,,Thank you!


; ===== intro =====
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.94,0:25:28.34,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Next up: self-intros.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.44,0:25:34.78,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Still not used to this spot… One by one, self-intros on today's theme.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.86,0:25:38.02,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Today's theme is: members whose first impression
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.60,0:25:45.18,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,and current impression are different. Starting with Nagano-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.26,0:25:49.90,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,When I say "what percent," say Rara percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.02,0:25:53.06,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,What's today's mood percent?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.80,0:25:54.64,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Rara percent!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.72,0:25:57.02,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,Rara-pa is what percent?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.74,0:25:58.54,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,Rara percent!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.28,0:26:01.02,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,Rara's dance is 100%?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.82,0:26:02.62,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,200%?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.24,0:26:04.04,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,Rara percent!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.85,0:26:10.15,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,Thank you! Nagasaki, 14 — Rara-pa, Nagano Rara.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.23,0:26:11.23,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.42,0:26:23.10,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,The member whose first impression felt different is…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.18,0:26:24.16,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,Ayane —
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.06,0:26:29.04,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,Which one? Ryuto's Ayane — the one who isn't here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.63,0:26:38.04,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,We've known each other about four years now,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.12,0:26:40.54,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,and when we first met,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.52,0:26:46.82,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,she's still young, but she was so little and floaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.44,0:26:53.34,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,I wondered if we could ever get close — but now we're super close.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.74,0:26:58.93,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,We talk a lot and send each other funny faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.01,0:26:59.71,Generic,Rara,0,0,60,,That's how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.62,0:27:01.98,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please take care of us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.06,0:27:04.34,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.58,0:27:10.86,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,When I point the mic: Magokoro, se-no, and Amiyun — together, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.74,0:27:16.32,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,60,,Shiritori — here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.90,0:27:20.20,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,60,,Little devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.94,0:27:21.74,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,60,,Magokoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.54,0:27:23.34,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,60,,Long hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.42,0:27:26.24,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Amiyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.10,0:27:28.56,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,60,,Fukuoka's lucky girl is…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.98,0:27:30.60,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Amiyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.95,0:27:34.75,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,60,,Thank you! Fukuoka, 13 — Amiyun, Ishikawa Amiyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.83,0:27:35.61,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.19,0:27:41.55,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.31,0:27:47.53,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,60,,The member whose impression changed the most for me is Ishii Ayane.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.91,0:27:52.03,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,60,,At the audition she seemed so neat and a bit quiet —
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.97,0:27:56.75,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,60,,a quiet, quiet, cute girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.83,0:28:00.43,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,60,,Now she's still cute… but funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.51,0:28:05.75,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,60,,Not "stylish funny" — more like offbeat funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.83,0:28:07.83,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please take care of us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.91,0:28:09.88,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.18,0:28:14.32,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,If I say "angelic little devil"…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.40,0:28:18.52,Generic,Karen-ren,0,0,60,,I want to be your angel-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.28,0:28:19.68,Generic,Karen-ren,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.34,0:28:23.50,Generic,Karen-ren,0,0,60,,Nagasaki, 18 — Karen-ren, Fukui Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.96,0:28:25.36,Generic,Karen-ren,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.52,0:28:28.10,Generic,Karen-ren,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.60,0:28:31.10,Generic,Karen-ren,0,0,60,,Um, the member whose impression changed is…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.18,0:28:32.78,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yuina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.86,0:28:37.94,Generic,Karen-ren,0,0,60,,I think everyone feels this — when she joined she was about this small,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.02,0:28:43.34,Generic,Karen-ren,0,0,60,,couldn't even say her own name, so fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.42,0:28:48.86,Generic,Karen-ren,0,0,60,,But now she blurts things at me in a strong tone,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.94,0:28:51.10,Generic,Karen-ren,0,0,60,,so I kind of want the old her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.58,0:28:53.02,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please take care of us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.44,0:28:55.20,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.36,0:28:59.70,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Rin-rin — Rinka!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.24,0:29:04.34,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,Bit by bit from little things — charm point: sparkling big eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.42,0:29:07.98,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,From Hyogo Prefecture, high-school 3rd year, 17 — Ouchi Rinka.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.06,0:29:09.42,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Rinka!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.64,0:29:12.04,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.04,0:29:17.88,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,The one whose impression changed… Kokoha.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.74,0:29:23.30,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,At the 6th-gen training-camp audition we shared a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.38,0:29:27.28,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,If I said "let's go buy drinks," Kokoha would go,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.36,0:29:32.14,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,"I'm fine" — reserved, and a kind kid —
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.08,0:29:33.44,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.06,0:29:40.86,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,Now she's gotten a bit sharp-tongued, but she also got discovered as funny lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.24,0:29:42.90,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,which makes me a little jealous,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.86,0:29:45.58,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,but yeah — she's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.66,0:29:46.74,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please take care of us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.82,0:29:49.78,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Nice to meet you — yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.64,0:29:52.72,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,HKT48 Team H —
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.80,0:29:56.14,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Yuuna, Yamauchi Yuna! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.04,0:29:57.40,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.13,0:30:01.59,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,The member whose impression changed is Ishimatsu Yuina.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.01,0:30:08.63,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,I've said this so many times — early on, even hearing her voice was rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.17,0:30:12.17,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,It was only yes or no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.25,0:30:16.07,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Lately, in close formations she hugs me,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.34,0:30:23.24,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,makes hearts,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.84,0:30:26.48,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,and likes my posts on X a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.30,0:30:28.80,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Why do you do that with everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.74,0:30:32.06,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,I'm melting over that side of her. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.14,0:30:33.18,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please take care of us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.26,0:30:35.04,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.90,0:30:41.74,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,February 9 is Meat Day — beef tongue, pork tongue — Hina-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.90,0:30:42.36,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.24,0:30:47.42,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,60,,Fukuoka, 3rd-year junior high, 14, Team KIV — Yasui Hina.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.50,0:30:48.38,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Hina-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.80,0:30:49.16,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.20,0:30:55.76,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,60,,The one whose first vs now is different for me is Han-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.44,0:31:02.78,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,60,,In her audition photos she had twin tails with tons of flowers,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.34,0:31:07.46,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,60,,and now she's got curls, cute, and grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.54,0:31:13.28,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,60,,We're the same age — and my birthday is even later,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.36,0:31:15.24,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,60,,so I'm actually older,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.84,0:31:18.84,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,60,,but people still call me the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.04,0:31:20.80,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,60,,Yeah — people do say you don't look it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.06,0:31:24.48,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Wait — don't get prickly there. Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.12,0:31:30.54,Generic,Hina-tan,0,0,60,,Watching Han-chan grow makes me think I need to try harder too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.62,0:31:32.34,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please take care of us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.42,0:31:34.16,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.70,0:31:39.78,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,When I say se-no, give me Kokoha, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.48,0:31:41.20,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.28,0:31:44.08,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,60,,Where is this place? Who am I? Se-no —
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.16,0:31:45.42,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Kokoha!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.74,0:31:46.42,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.00,0:31:50.54,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,60,,Fukuoka, high-school 2nd year, 16 — Fujino Kokoha.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.26,0:31:54.64,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.64,0:32:01.68,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,60,,Mine is Rinka — Rinka's a bit scary, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.54,0:32:08.48,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,60,,We shared a five-person room, and only Rinka practiced alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.56,0:32:10.48,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,60,,Even if you said "practice together,"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.24,0:32:14.86,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,60,,she'd go, "I'm good already — going to sleep," and pass out alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.94,0:32:21.02,Generic,Kokoha,0,0,60,,Looking back, she's been living healthy since then — unchanged, and adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.10,0:32:22.58,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please take care of us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.94,0:32:24.40,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.29,0:32:28.47,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Troubled face and droopy eyes are my charm point.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.55,0:32:30.61,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,Always smiling? Yuina!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.33,0:32:34.65,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,It's Yuina! 2nd-year junior high, 13 — Ishimatsu Yuina.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.73,0:32:35.75,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.09,0:32:36.57,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,Yuina!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.19,0:32:37.74,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.74,0:32:43.44,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,Mine is Karen-ren.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.14,0:32:49.24,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,From the audition her dance was amazing — she seemed scary —
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.14,0:32:55.74,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,but now she doesn't just stick close; she comes in for hugs,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.82,0:32:59.22,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,and she's kind to lots of members.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.30,0:33:02.48,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,With lots of members she…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.74,0:33:07.36,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,hangs out?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.28,0:33:12.32,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,Yeah, hangs out — so she's scary in a different way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.40,0:33:14.00,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please take care of us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.06,0:33:16.80,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.44,0:33:22.48,Generic,Sae-chan,0,0,60,,HKT48 Team H — Sae-chan, Kurihara Sae.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.22,0:33:23.76,Generic,Sae-chan,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.66,0:33:28.10,Generic,Sae-chan,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.78,0:33:31.50,Generic,Sae-chan,0,0,60,,Mine is Fujikoko-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.44,0:33:38.86,Generic,Sae-chan,0,0,60,,Her face is cute — I thought she was a really quiet kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.94,0:33:42.64,Generic,Sae-chan,0,0,60,,But from Fujikoko's birthday show day, she changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.73,0:33:45.27,Generic,Sae-chan,0,0,60,,No I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.58,0:33:49.06,Generic,Sae-chan,0,0,60,,I didn't think she was that kind of kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.60,0:33:50.42,Generic,Sae-chan,0,0,60,,but…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.30,0:33:57.12,Generic,Sae-chan,0,0,60,,now she talks forever with no sense of time — Team H raised her that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.20,0:33:58.36,Generic,Sae-chan,0,0,60,,Exactly, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.66,0:34:03.50,Generic,Sae-chan,0,0,60,,I hate that part too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.78,0:34:09.52,Generic,Sae-chan,0,0,60,,But it's Fujikoko's charm — you can't hate her; she's precious. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.86,0:34:17.30,Generic,Sae-chan,0,0,60,,From now on I want to teach Fujikoko-san the word "modesty."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.38,0:34:18.50,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.06,0:34:20.40,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.71,0:34:25.94,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Everyone — claps and calls together, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.81,0:34:32.44,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,60,,Looking sharp today — Saaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.52,0:34:36.48,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,60,,Coloring your mind — Saaya! Saka Agari show — take care of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.56,0:34:37.88,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Uu-Saaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.78,0:34:39.18,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.64,0:34:43.18,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,60,,Kumamoto, 20, Team KIV — Morisaki Saaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.20,0:34:44.60,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.15,0:34:55.75,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,60,,The member who changed from early days is Mei-mei, Yoshida Mei —
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.27,0:34:57.95,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,60,,especially her laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.39,0:35:00.77,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,You know —
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.85,0:35:03.95,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,60,,she did ballet, and she plays violin,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.03,0:35:08.07,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,60,,and her face has that ojou-sama vibe, so I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.15,0:35:14.51,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,60,,"ohohohoho" — but now she cackles gah-gah-gah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.95,0:35:20.67,Generic,Saa-chan,0,0,60,,And her funny bone is so easy — yeah I get that — that was the real surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.75,0:35:22.49,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please take care of us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.57,0:35:23.41,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.28,0:35:31.24,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,When I lean in, say Mei-mei, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.62,0:35:34.93,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,60,,Melon-loving…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.01,0:35:35.81,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Mei-mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.89,0:35:36.91,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,60,,Always energetic…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.99,0:35:37.57,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Mei-mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.65,0:35:38.65,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,60,,Bright smiling…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.73,0:35:39.43,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Mei-mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.51,0:35:44.45,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,60,,Thank you! Yamaguchi, high-school 1st year, 16 — Mei-mei, Yoshida Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.53,0:35:45.41,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.49,0:35:46.79,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Mei-mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.93,0:35:51.45,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,60,,Wait — that wasn't uu-Mei-mei. Different.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.09,0:35:57.19,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,60,,The member whose impression changed is…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.27,0:36:00.47,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,60,,7th gen Yamakawa Maria — oh yeah —
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.55,0:36:06.49,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,60,,At the audition she was floaty and a bit big-sisterly,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.57,0:36:07.33,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,60,,and like…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.41,0:36:08.99,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,that sort of vibe,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.07,0:36:13.49,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,60,,but if you watch her Showroom now you'll see —
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.57,0:36:19.11,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,60,,she's funny and full of energy, and I like that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.19,0:36:21.11,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please take care of us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.19,0:36:22.93,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.65,0:36:29.93,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,When I say "naritai," say "naritai" back, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.08,0:36:36.50,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,I want to become a gentle flower that blooms in Hakata — I want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.46,0:36:38.01,Generic,Yuka-chan,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.10,0:36:41.18,Generic,Yuka-chan,0,0,60,,I love acting and guitar — Yuka-chan, Akiyoshi Yuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.99,0:36:51.57,Generic,Yuka-chan,0,0,60,,The one whose first impression changed is still Yuina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.43,0:36:56.05,Generic,Yuka-chan,0,0,60,,I watched the final of Kibou no Tsubomi,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.71,0:37:02.81,Generic,Yuka-chan,0,0,60,,and when everyone said thanks for the last show, Yuina couldn't speak at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.13,0:37:08.81,Generic,Yuka-chan,0,0,60,,I watched thinking "this'll get clipped online,"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.05,0:37:14.47,Generic,Yuka-chan,0,0,60,,Talking felt like a miracle — but lately when you talk to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.55,0:37:16.91,Generic,Yuka-chan,0,0,60,,she'll go "hai" like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.15,0:37:19.27,Generic,Yuka-chan,0,0,60,,Still though…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.81,0:37:22.33,Generic,Yuka-chan,0,0,60,,it feels like you're conversing at an angle,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.73,0:37:29.05,Generic,Yuka-chan,0,0,60,,she always talks from this angle — I hope someday we can talk eye to eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.13,0:37:30.85,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please take care of us today too!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.52,0:37:39.38,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,When I point the mic: Ayane iro and Eighteen, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.94,0:37:41.34,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.56,0:37:45.60,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,This tone is — Ayane iro! Ayane iro!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.02,0:37:49.04,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,Your heart too — Ayane iro!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.32,0:37:50.94,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,From Fukuoka Prefecture…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.12,0:37:55.42,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,It's Mother's Day, so I want to get to where I can do a real saka-agari — Eighteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.12,0:37:57.10,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,Ishii Ayane.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.18,0:37:58.24,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.89,0:38:03.29,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.43,0:38:08.23,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,The member whose first impression changed is…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.77,0:38:10.89,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,Matsumoto Moka-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.65,0:38:15.71,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,At the audition she seemed surprisingly put-together —
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.39,0:38:22.05,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,still is — still is! — good at dance, tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.13,0:38:25.01,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,I thought she was big-sisterly. Yeah. But…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.65,0:38:27.87,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,When you open the lid…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.49,0:38:32.01,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,her catchphrase is "born from a strawberry field,"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.75,0:38:34.73,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,and when she talks,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.41,0:38:37.79,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,half the time I have no idea what she's saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.31,0:38:41.95,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,But that side… I think Ishii-san's the same? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.02,0:38:49.66,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,Yeah — but I'm put-together enough that I won't lose to Moka-chan! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.50,0:38:50.86,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.59,0:38:56.73,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,Don't look shocked! Why do you answer like that at times like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.33,0:39:02.47,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,You even called us the Meoto-iwa (Married Couple Rocks) couple — stop — that's rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.70,0:39:07.50,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,60,,Someday I want to be able to read "Meoto-iwa."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.90,0:39:09.78,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please take care of us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.26,0:39:11.04,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.04,0:39:14.92,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,When I lean in…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.00,0:39:16.30,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,60,,"Moka-pi" and "you're cute," please!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.38,0:39:17.82,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.25,0:39:20.99,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Born from a strawberry field…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.45,0:39:25.25,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,60,,Moka-pi! Cute like a strawberry blossom today?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.45,0:39:26.47,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,You're cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.17,0:39:30.57,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,60,,Thank you! Fresh as a strawberry, 16 — Matsumoto Moka.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.65,0:39:31.63,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.38,0:39:33.74,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.58,0:39:40.32,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,60,,The member whose first impression changed is Rara.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.80,0:39:45.72,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,60,,At the audition she had great style and dance —
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.80,0:39:51.84,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,60,,so cool I almost gave up — but today I did a skit,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.92,0:39:55.48,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,60,,and she played four roles by herself as my opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.56,0:40:00.36,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,60,,That committed, and really in-character,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.44,0:40:02.56,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,60,,I realized she's an incredibly funny kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.64,0:40:04.52,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please take care of us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.60,0:40:06.44,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.07,0:40:10.95,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,When I point the mic…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.03,0:40:12.01,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,"Risaki," please!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.09,0:40:13.25,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.91,0:40:20.01,Generic,Risaki,0,0,60,,From morning to night I want you filled with Risaki — morning! Night!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.85,0:40:22.67,Generic,Risaki,0,0,60,,Got everyone's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.60,0:40:26.40,Generic,Risaki,0,0,60,,Thank you! Age 20 — Oba Risaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.99,0:40:29.68,Generic,Risaki,0,0,60,,Risaki-saaan! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.73,0:40:31.28,Generic,Risaki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.03,0:40:36.95,Generic,Risaki,0,0,60,,The member whose first impression changed is Karen-ren.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.39,0:40:42.79,Generic,Risaki,0,0,60,,At the audition we passed pens out from the front in order —
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.33,0:40:47.35,Generic,Risaki,0,0,60,,not exactly a test — and Karen-ren was up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.71,0:40:53.21,Generic,Risaki,0,0,60,,She had a super high ponytail, and when she handed it over she went "hai,"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.59,0:40:58.67,Generic,Risaki,0,0,60,,and I thought "whoa, scary kid — better not get involved."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.55,0:41:03.89,Generic,Risaki,0,0,60,,But she's actually really kind and cute, so I want to keep hanging out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.97,0:41:05.85,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please take care of us today too!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.93,0:41:07.87,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.17,0:41:13.21,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,When I point the mic: Han-chaka-chan, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.29,0:41:14.61,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.27,0:41:17.17,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,60,,Bonds that link everyone's love!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.25,0:41:23.03,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Han-chaka-chan~! Yes — received! Oita, 3rd-year junior high…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.11,0:41:26.81,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,60,,14, a little scatterbrained — Ihara Hanna. Call me Han-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.89,0:41:27.87,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.95,0:41:29.39,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Han-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.78,0:41:34.33,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.10,0:41:39.64,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,60,,The member whose first impression changed is Ishii Ayane.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.20,0:41:44.92,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,60,,When I saw her at the reveal, her face was so cute —
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.00,0:41:49.92,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,60,,I thought ojou-sama type, but no — wait wait wait —
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.00,0:41:52.60,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,60,,On my birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.48,0:41:59.76,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,60,,I ran into Ishii Ayane at a shoot, and she came over: "Hana-san, happy birthday,"
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.84,0:42:01.44,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,60,,"You're still so young," like that —
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.34,0:42:07.22,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,60,,Why is your tone so low? Not princess-like at all —
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.30,0:42:13.06,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,60,,Cute, sure, but a funny character —
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.14,0:42:14.56,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,60,,so I want to get closer from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.64,0:42:16.32,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Please take care of us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.40,0:42:18.48,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.24,0:42:26.16,Generic,Announce,0,0,60,,Thank you! HKT48 Himawarigumi Saka Agari — these are tonight's members.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.24,0:42:28.72,Generic,Announce,0,0,60,,Everyone still ready to go harder?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.80,0:42:30.18,Generic,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.74,0:42:35.68,Generic,Announce,0,0,60,,Thank you! Next, various unit tones — first, this way.


; ===== post_song_sketch =====
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.18,0:51:25.68,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,Yui-chan, today was your first Wagamama na Nagareboshi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.88,0:51:26.72,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,Was it cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.36,0:51:29.32,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,Eh… so-so, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.40,0:51:32.80,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,No — what do you mean?! Even if it's flattery, say it was cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.88,0:51:33.58,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,Ehh…


; ===== mc1 =====
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.39,1:05:42.43,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,End Roll, Wagamama na Nagareboshi, Ai no Iro,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.50,1:05:46.73,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Dakishimeraretara, and Mushi no Ballad—
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.80,1:05:50.48,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,you just heard five songs in a row.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.34,1:05:52.94,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.01,1:05:54.09,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.73,1:05:59.23,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Today we'd like to talk with these five of us—
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.30,1:06:00.51,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Amiyu-chan, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.05,1:06:07.95,Generic,Amiyu,0,0,0,,Earlier today was my first time doing the End Roll unit.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.11,1:06:08.71,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.35,1:06:09.95,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.39,1:06:11.08,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.15,1:06:16.03,Generic,Amiyu,0,0,0,,It was my first time, and I'm really bad at learning choreography,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.15,1:06:19.29,Generic,Amiyu,0,0,0,,so I was super nervous right up until the show,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.37,1:06:23.54,Generic,Amiyu,0,0,0,,but Karen-san kindly checked in because I was nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.61,1:06:24.59,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,What's that move?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.05,1:06:26.98,Generic,Amiyu,0,0,0,,And that really melted my nerves away.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.05,1:06:27.65,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.72,1:06:28.32,Generic,Amiyu,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.89,1:06:29.50,Generic,Karen,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.64,1:06:31.52,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.30,1:06:33.70,Generic,Karen,0,0,0,,I'm glad I spoke up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.14,1:06:36.16,Generic,Amiyu,0,0,0,,I'm glad too.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.02,1:06:38.84,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Okay — and the Wagamama pair?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.02,1:06:40.64,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Wagamama pair?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.44,1:06:44.56,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,This was my first time doing Wagamama na Nagareboshi.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.70,1:06:46.90,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,You two did it together.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.52,1:06:52.58,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,First time with Yuina-chan — I was so happy, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.92,1:06:55.90,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Were you really happy?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.28,1:06:57.18,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,I'm really happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.12,1:07:01.16,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,But Rinka looks super happy,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.32,1:07:02.90,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,happy she gets to do it with Yuina,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.00,1:07:05.50,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,and happy she gets to do Wagamama na Nagareboshi.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.40,1:07:07.70,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,She's really fired up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.32,1:07:10.56,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Those high twin-tails and all.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.08,1:07:13.22,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Hey, cute looks are fine once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.18,1:07:14.89,Generic,Fujikoko,0,0,0,,Because it's rare for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.96,1:07:15.77,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,Let me get fired up!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.84,1:07:17.86,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Right — you did a sketch too.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.98,1:07:21.43,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,We did a tiny sketch — well, a mini-sketch—
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.50,1:07:23.32,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,and it was really cute, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.60,1:07:24.62,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.94,1:07:27.62,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,You've been making her say that this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.98,1:07:32.54,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,In the sketch I ask "Cute?" and she goes "Not cute!" —
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.72,1:07:34.15,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,but honestly…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.22,1:07:35.26,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,I think she's cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.54,1:07:38.14,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,You're really making her say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.40,1:07:41.07,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,But talking about Yuina—
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.14,1:07:46.27,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,Yuina likes that dyed golden hair look.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.34,1:07:49.18,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,When I dyed mine, she'd say "Cute!"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.44,1:07:50.99,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,Then yesterday—
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.06,1:07:53.36,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,I went back to black hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.68,1:07:58.06,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,And when I saw Yuina,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.14,1:07:59.97,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,without me even asking "Cute?",
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.04,1:08:01.56,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,she said she hates this color.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.40,1:08:03.84,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.62,1:08:05.50,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,"I hate it," she said.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.84,1:08:07.72,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Come on…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.06,1:08:09.86,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Even if it's just flattery, you've got to say she was cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.06,1:08:10.70,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.02,1:08:13.30,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,She'll get mad — she'll get mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.72,1:08:15.00,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,See? See? Scary even now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.48,1:08:17.07,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,Move over a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.35,1:08:19.79,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,So? What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.07,1:08:21.93,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,I think it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.45,1:08:25.35,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Oh nooo.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.32,1:08:31.23,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,But Yuina's always like that — and I'm always trying different hair looks,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.30,1:08:34.62,Generic,Rinka,0,0,0,,and she'll go, "I hate today's Rinka hair."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.82,1:08:36.60,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,She's so sharp-tongued.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.82,1:08:40.10,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,She's past her rebellious phase, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.34,1:08:41.60,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Since when did she get like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.28,1:08:43.88,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.95,1:08:45.09,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,It's sad for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.16,1:08:45.76,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.83,1:08:47.09,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,She used to be so little.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.66,1:08:48.26,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.38,1:08:51.28,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,She came to the audition hugging a stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.38,1:08:52.12,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.30,1:08:52.90,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yeah, she did.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.97,1:08:53.67,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.74,1:08:57.73,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,A huge one — like, as tall as she was—
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.80,1:09:00.84,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,with curly twin-tails, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.06,1:09:03.54,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Amiyun, don't you go turning out like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.34,1:09:06.29,Generic,Amiyu,0,0,0,,But Yuina-san is really kind—
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.36,1:09:08.19,Generic,Amiyu,0,0,0,,right before we went on for Saka Agari,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.26,1:09:10.95,Generic,Amiyu,0,0,0,,she said, "Let's do our best for sure."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.02,1:09:12.66,Generic,Karen,0,0,0,,She's playing the senpai.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.74,1:09:13.44,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,She's doing that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.76,1:09:15.42,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't say that myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.68,1:09:16.28,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.35,1:09:17.41,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Then who said it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.62,1:09:18.31,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,What what?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.38,1:09:22.06,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,No — Amiyu-chan came and said "Let's do our best," to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.28,1:09:23.89,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,And "Let's work hard together."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.96,1:09:24.86,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,See, it wasn't from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.94,1:09:25.54,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ahh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.61,1:09:26.29,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,So she didn't say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.48,1:09:28.19,Generic,Amiyu,0,0,0,,But she does hold my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.26,1:09:28.86,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.10,1:09:30.58,Generic,Amiyu,0,0,0,,Like, "Hold my hand a sec."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.32,1:09:32.33,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,That's amazing — amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.40,1:09:33.56,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Not with us, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.90,1:09:34.88,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I'm actually jealous.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.20,1:09:36.84,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Jealous.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.06,1:09:37.66,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Aww.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.73,1:09:38.33,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Or maybe not?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.24,1:09:40.36,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yeah — all casual.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.56,1:09:43.36,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Well then — stay close like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.46,1:09:44.06,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.13,1:09:46.63,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I'd be happy if Yuina-chan leans on us,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.70,1:09:49.26,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,and if you stay close with Amiyu-chan too.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.46,1:09:50.10,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.50,1:09:53.52,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Anyway — the second half is still going!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.72,1:09:55.68,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Everyone ready to get hyped?!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.59,1:09:59.03,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.10,1:10:00.81,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,The second half starts with this song.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.01,1:10:01.61,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Here we go.


; ===== mc2 =====
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.62,1:24:21.08,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You've just heard three songs in a row.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.30,1:24:22.84,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Is everyone fired up?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.98,1:24:29.80,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thank you! For the first half, we'd like to talk with this group—
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.26,1:24:32.14,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,There are so many 7th gens, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.54,1:24:38.02,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,They multiplied somehow. You can barely tell who's 7th gen anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.76,1:24:40.12,Generic,Fujikoko,0,0,140,,That's the worst.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:38.76,1:24:40.12,Generic,Hina,0,0,60,,…you can tell, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.74,1:24:46.66,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Still nervous? Nope—I'm not nervous anymore. Good. What about Ishii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.74,1:24:51.64,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ishii-chan? She's giving off that veteran vibe.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.60,1:24:57.50,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Nice. The dressing room's really lively, huh? Is it really?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.70,1:25:05.14,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,Today Ishii-chan was talking about some 7th gen whose lashes weren't lifted,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.30,1:25:06.94,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,and the line she used then.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.54,1:25:08.54,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.77,1:25:14.51,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,Right—we were talking makeup,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.03,1:25:19.17,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,and she said half-hearted makeup won't cut it. Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.17,1:25:22.41,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,She explained it with a baby airplane lift.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.63,1:25:27.79,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,If you do a baby lift here, that's not a high lift, is it, Fujikoko?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.15,1:25:33.80,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,Fujikoko? That startled me. Once you're up this high, it's a high lift, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.06,1:25:38.06,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,So she said your lashes have to go high-lift too.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.32,1:25:38.96,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Is that so.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.34,1:25:41.20,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.50,1:25:43.32,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I'm not scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.80,1:25:49.36,Generic,Saaya,0,0,0,,Her delivery was amazing—I was impressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.44,1:25:50.66,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,Dago — thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.43,1:25:53.35,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Apparently it didn't go over that well.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.85,1:25:54.40,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.49,1:25:56.01,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.09,1:26:01.69,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Managers and makeup artists said the 7th gens are so energetic—awesome—but
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.85,1:26:04.67,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,once we're in the same dressing room, they're really loud.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.15,1:26:08.25,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Today they were supposedly holding back.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.33,1:26:14.67,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,With senpai around… a 7th-gen-only show would be a total zoo.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.75,1:26:17.32,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,But the energetic ones are these two right here. Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.40,1:26:18.43,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,No we're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.71,1:26:19.26,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.51,1:26:20.37,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,No—it's Amiyun.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.49,1:26:22.21,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,That's different.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.03,1:26:26.53,Generic,Yuka,0,0,0,,I've been thinking—people have told me this—
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.61,1:26:30.13,Generic,Yuka,0,0,0,,lately I think Maria is the noisiest of the 7th gens.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.21,1:26:35.75,Generic,Yuka,0,0,0,,True. Yamauchi-chan, right? Yamauchi-chan? Yes. She likes me a lot, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.87,1:26:39.09,Generic,Yuka,0,0,0,,she never really talks to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.81,1:26:43.97,Generic,Yuka,0,0,0,,She said something—she's too shy to talk to Yuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.41,1:26:45.05,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Oh, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.33,1:26:45.91,Generic,Yuka,0,0,0,,That's what she said.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.19,1:26:52.33,Generic,Yuka,0,0,0,,She just says "good work," leaves without a word, then a LINE arrives: "I love you."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.23,1:26:55.25,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,A little scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.01,1:26:59.35,Generic,Yuka,0,0,0,,Wild. I'm thinking, just talk normally…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.69,1:27:01.35,Generic,Yuka,0,0,0,,Kind of horror, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.03,1:27:03.53,Generic,Yuka,0,0,0,,Really, really scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.91,1:27:09.47,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,I felt a bit of horror today too—I was changing, into the Dakishimeraretara costume,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.73,1:27:12.77,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,and Ishii-chan goes, "Risaki-san, I can see you~"
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.13,1:27:14.35,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,Wow. Peering in.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.25,1:27:18.13,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,She peeked right in. I thought it was a bit like horror.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.67,1:27:22.03,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,It was a little sexy. Risaki-san was—
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.35,1:27:26.25,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,But ever since unveil, Risaki-san's been teasing like that,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.33,1:27:30.31,Generic,Ayane,0,0,0,,so I figured it's okay if I do it too.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.75,1:27:32.99,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yikes. Wait—is it my fault? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.31,1:27:35.48,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Alright then—keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.52,1:27:37.24,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,So it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.26,1:27:40.11,Generic,Members,0,0,0,,7th gens are really funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.19,1:27:45.23,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,The other day I got to do End Roll in the show,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.75,1:27:51.97,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,and End Roll doesn't require a cartwheel, exactly,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.07,1:27:55.03,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,but mid-song there's a spot where you hit a trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.37,1:28:00.09,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I was on it with Yoshida Mei-mei—two 7th gens.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.01,1:28:04.71,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,So I went to Hanna-san for advice: I can't cartwheel—
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.79,1:28:08.57,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,how do I get better?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.65,1:28:12.95,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,And she goes, "Well Mei-mei looks like she can, so you're fine."
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.25,1:28:13.80,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.13,1:28:20.59,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Exactly. When I said "what about me?" she just went ahahaha.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.71,1:28:21.87,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yikes—she's dodging.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.33,1:28:27.49,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Han-chan's just like that. She is? Don't bully her.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.57,1:28:30.65,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Don't bully her.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.73,1:28:33.13,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Did you get the cartwheel down?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.20,1:28:34.75,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Uh—I wiped out last time. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.53,1:28:36.79,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,You okay? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.27,1:28:39.09,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Totally fine. And Fujikoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.73,1:28:41.15,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Scary. Scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.41,1:28:42.99,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,But—but—but. Poor Fujikoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.45,1:28:49.81,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Even Han-chan cartwheels in recent shows—and she looked like a frog. True. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.89,1:28:53.81,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Han-chan too. She gets that. Okay—let's work on it together.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.91,1:28:58.07,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Now I feel like people call me a frog too, and I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.95,1:29:00.99,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.25,1:29:02.61,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Cartwheels, yeah. Well—Fujikoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.09,1:29:03.64,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.31,1:29:07.23,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Hey, even Akiyoshi-san—stop piling on when someone's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.07,1:29:08.83,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,When you're in trouble…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.47,1:29:15.85,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Akiyoshi-san, how is it from a senpai view—juniors like this? Honestly, like a zookeeper.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.71,1:29:20.65,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So it was a zoo. Zoo vibes. Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.23,1:29:22.77,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please keep looking after us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.39,1:29:23.94,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.27,1:29:24.82,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.09,1:29:26.71,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please. Please, Akiyoshi-san. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.53,1:29:30.77,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,And stop sending "I love you" on LINE later without talking first.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.71,1:29:32.26,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.35,1:29:35.69,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,If you can, talk lots on site, okay? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.05,1:29:38.79,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So we'll have Akiyoshi-san keep looking after the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.23,1:29:40.87,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Next up—the second-half group. Come on out.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.49,1:29:48.04,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.57,1:29:52.83,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Today we'd like to talk with this group. Okay—Han-chan. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.59,1:30:00.09,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,0,,At a past Saka Agari show, Yuina-san said on MC that party poppers are hard—
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.71,1:30:07.15,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,0,,like only one shot comes out. You don't have to dig that up.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.59,1:30:14.73,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,0,,She said that, and I teased her hard—"that's a talent too." Yeah, you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.81,1:30:20.99,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,0,,I teased her—and today I learned how hard poppers are. Ooh. Same as Yuina-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.73,1:30:27.83,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,0,,Whoa. Found a friend. When I went bang, the whole popper flew off. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.93,1:30:33.89,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,0,,All that was left in my hand was like… a string? Just the string—I freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.13,1:30:38.11,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,0,,The second I saw the string I thought, I'm just like Yuina-san. Why'd you think that?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.40,1:30:45.96,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I did. Don't remember me by poppers. But Han-chan—you can basketball-dribble, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.88,1:30:52.05,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Hey—no. I can. Digging that up is banned.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.17,1:30:56.47,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yuina-chan can't do this stick-handling thing. What—I can. See?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.11,1:30:57.66,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.91,1:31:00.67,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Someone swapped seats next to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.77,1:31:02.55,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Nooo, nooo.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.50,1:31:06.22,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Well then—Yuina-chan, were you interested just now?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.46,1:31:09.78,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You weren't, right? Yeah, not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.15,1:31:12.95,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.96,1:31:14.62,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Don't leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.67,1:31:16.45,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Don't go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.47,1:31:18.61,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Well then…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.45,1:31:21.31,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Mei-mei—anything from you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.39,1:31:26.11,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Um—today's show had so many happy moments for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.39,1:31:26.93,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.01,1:31:30.38,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Seniors met my eyes a lot, and
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.46,1:31:34.13,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,earlier with Yuina-san—what was it—
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.21,1:31:40.21,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,during Machikado Party I was off alone going whoo~, then I went to Yuina-san and she linked arms with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.51,1:31:41.21,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.41,1:31:46.31,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Karen, Karen—cover your ears. She's sweeter to the 7th gens.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.67,1:31:47.75,Generic,Karen,0,0,0,,7th gens—
Dialogue: 1,1:31:47.75,1:31:48.35,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,I get it, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.35,1:31:48.75,Generic,Karen,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.75,1:31:50.09,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Cold to her own gen, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.73,1:31:51.31,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,For real.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.71,1:31:56.17,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Is that true? It is. I kind of want to get closer too.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.59,1:32:01.71,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Ooh. Also—I still can't believe people call Yuina-san with -san. Same.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.93,1:32:04.41,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yuina—at first she was only about this big,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.55,1:32:06.55,Generic,Sae,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.58,1:32:10.78,Generic,Sae,0,0,0,,Sorry — this probably wasn't on the audition form, but
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.14,1:32:15.86,Generic,Sae,0,0,0,,that was my impression: only about this big, yet she's Yuina-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.94,1:32:17.49,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.58,1:32:19.44,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,That's Yuina-san. Amazing, Yuina.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.12,1:32:26.12,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,At unveil Yuina said she wanted to be friends with the 7th gens, so I went over,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.20,1:32:29.98,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,thinking she'd talk—and she didn't talk at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.28,1:32:32.70,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,She used me as a wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.54,1:32:34.88,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Why make me a wall too?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.12,1:32:36.94,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.88,1:32:42.06,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,I wondered if they were talking to me. So I'm working on it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.93,1:32:46.05,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,You teaching dance? Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.25,1:32:48.17,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.25,1:32:53.60,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I only get to see the juniors
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.68,1:32:57.11,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,at shows like Saka Agari,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.91,1:33:00.31,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,and today—Ichigo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.07,1:33:02.05,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ichigo-chan, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.31,1:33:04.49,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,There's a girl called Ichigo-chan,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.33,1:33:07.09,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,You should probably give the full name.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.17,1:33:12.47,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Matsumoto Moka-chan talks to me a lot and asks to take photos.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.41,1:33:14.91,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,The other day, on YouTube—
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.33,1:33:21.23,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ichigo-chan's YouTube even said my name. Yes. She's kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.47,1:33:26.27,Generic,Moka,0,0,0,,I love Sae-san — she's gorgeous, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.34,1:33:28.49,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,As you all know.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.01,1:33:31.03,Generic,Moka,0,0,0,,So I want to become like Sae-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.69,1:33:36.81,Generic,Moka,0,0,0,,But I don't know how to become Sae-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.97,1:33:41.63,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,First I figured I'd fix my posture. Also—she's slow to get ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.60,1:33:48.20,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,You don't need to copy that part.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.30,1:33:52.30,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Right. Ichigo-chan talks to me like that, but
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.48,1:33:56.30,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,looking back, I only ever got close with weird juniors.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.66,1:34:00.14,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,You okay? Starting with Matsumoto Hinata,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.12,1:34:01.67,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.04,1:34:05.18,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ichimura Airi, Shibui Mina. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.86,1:34:07.24,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Kind of… strong quirks.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.14,1:34:12.98,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,How do I put it—members with big personality quirks who liked me,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.46,1:34:15.10,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,and finally, properly…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.74,1:34:16.80,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.34,1:34:21.18,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I dunno. Finally a proper kid showed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.76,1:34:24.60,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Stop—that sounds like an award speech.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.42,1:34:26.90,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,No, I'm genuinely happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.22,1:34:28.81,Generic,Moka,0,0,0,,Then get along with Sae-san, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.89,1:34:29.72,Generic,Sae,0,0,0,,Let's.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.58,1:34:31.44,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.06,1:34:33.00,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Hey, Yuuna-chan—you're in the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.15,1:34:36.15,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You're so in the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.43,1:34:40.43,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry, sorry. Had to swap seats next to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.11,1:34:41.75,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.17,1:34:43.79,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I love Yuuna-san, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.21,1:34:44.76,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.85,1:34:47.75,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Who? Yuuna-san—yes. But yesterday Rinka was like I love Aichi—
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.38,1:34:50.62,Generic,Han-chan,0,0,0,,like "Aichi-ru."
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.34,1:34:52.92,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,No, no—but yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.18,1:34:54.88,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,From way back—or, well…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.20,1:34:56.58,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,You don't have to be so careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.28,1:35:00.88,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. I've been close with Yuuna-san lately too.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.42,1:35:02.28,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yeah, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.78,1:35:04.68,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ah—so you prepped a script.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.20,1:35:05.75,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.06,1:35:09.08,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,0,,True. True. But I've been talking with Karen a lot lately. We have.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.84,1:35:16.04,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Even in the van on the way home—chatting forever, like "this character's cute," you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.18,1:35:17.52,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,It's getting embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.66,1:35:20.82,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Can you stop with the paper-thin stories?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.15,1:35:24.85,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Hey—I'm close with Yuuna-san too.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.97,1:35:27.05,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.15,1:35:30.65,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Don't butt into the convo.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.10,1:35:35.40,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yuuna-san said today I cut my bangs too short—why say that?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.21,1:35:39.67,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,She reported it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.19,1:35:41.63,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,See—stop with the thin content.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.97,1:35:45.43,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I'm close with Yuuna-chan too. We're same gen.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.05,1:35:47.19,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Same gen. Same gen.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.47,1:35:49.65,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Got no episode, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.15,1:35:52.71,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.68,1:35:59.32,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Sorry. Sorry, sorry. I didn't prep. Mid-show, can I leave?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.02,1:36:02.22,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,No, no. Try a little harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.82,1:36:06.30,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You are trying a bit. Try harder. Interested, Yuina-chan?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.68,1:36:08.40,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.76,1:36:09.38,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.23,1:36:15.39,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Um—thank you for today.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.09,1:36:19.82,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Do your best.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.32,1:36:22.38,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Do your best. Will you? I'll try, I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.38,1:36:26.60,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Poor thing. Yuuna-chan was sick with a fever through yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.16,1:36:28.72,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,That's right. Poor thing. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.10,1:36:30.24,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,I'm okay. You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.10,1:36:32.86,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Okay. Cheer up. Cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.32,1:36:34.60,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Alright—Yuuna-chan, no more talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.68,1:36:35.80,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.18,1:36:37.54,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,Nothing left? Nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.04,1:36:39.06,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,I'm worn out.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.66,1:36:41.60,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yuina-chan—wrap it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.88,1:36:46.57,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I'll keep working to get closer with Yuuna-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.65,1:36:48.00,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You made her say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.28,1:36:51.96,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Okay. Everyone, please come out.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.39,1:37:03.37,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Now, please listen—Fan Letter.


; ===== mc3 =====
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.75,1:55:46.16,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You've just heard Hanpa na Ikemen and Fugiri back-to-back.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.23,1:55:47.67,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thank you for the encore!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.99,1:55:49.74,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.49,1:55:57.24,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.96,1:56:00.70,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,This show is heading toward the end, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.64,1:56:03.93,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So, Yamauchi-san — you were spinning the MC today.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.00,1:56:05.14,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,How was today?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.48,1:56:08.06,Generic,Yuna,0,0,0,,I have to talk here again?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.14,1:56:10.83,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You were really firing tsukkomi today.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.90,1:56:12.33,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,For real.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.40,1:56:14.40,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Kind of felt like a comedy master.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.56,1:56:16.45,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.52,1:56:17.23,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Good work, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.30,1:56:19.97,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You and Han-chan were the biggest boke.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.99,1:56:23.24,Generic,Yuna,0,0,0,,But it was really fun,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.31,1:56:25.67,Generic,Yuna,0,0,0,,you know, that Saka Agari-unique
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.05,1:56:28.45,Generic,Yuna,0,0,0,,kind of different member chemistry again,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.93,1:56:30.09,Generic,Yuna,0,0,0,,I'm a bit unsatisfied, though…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.23,1:56:33.14,Generic,Yuna,0,0,0,,but I still think this is fun too,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.21,1:56:36.34,Generic,Yuna,0,0,0,,so I'd be happy if you'd come see Saka Agari shows again.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.41,1:56:37.52,Generic,Yuna,0,0,0,,Thank you for today.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.43,1:56:44.19,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yuina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.75,1:56:46.81,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Can you chat?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.99,1:56:47.83,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.18,1:56:51.86,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming today.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.64,1:56:53.35,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.12,1:57:04.06,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,What should I say today?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.98,1:57:05.94,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,What you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.50,1:57:13.51,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,It's Mother's Day.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.58,1:57:14.96,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Mother's Day?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.56,1:57:17.45,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,I won't do anything, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.52,1:57:17.80,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.76,1:57:20.60,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.14,1:57:23.26,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,I'll keep being grateful going forward,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.18,1:57:25.01,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.08,1:57:25.87,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,that's what I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.94,1:57:27.79,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,Thank you to all the moms nationwide.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.14,1:57:28.66,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.66,1:57:30.18,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.18,1:57:35.62,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Hey — that girl who cried so much,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.28,1:57:37.38,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,can talk now.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.08,1:57:38.90,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Were you talking?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.50,1:57:40.25,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You weren't talking, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.32,1:57:41.89,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Why? Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.96,1:57:43.69,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You've grown a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.76,1:57:44.48,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.86,1:57:45.22,Generic,Yuina,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.07,1:57:48.61,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So like this — teams,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.05,1:57:52.24,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,and gens all mixed — that's Himawarigumi,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.31,1:57:55.95,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,and every time we get different chemistry,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.47,1:57:57.78,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,we see how many kinds of members there are,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.85,1:57:59.55,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,and get to know so many,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.29,1:58:02.96,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,so I hope you'll come see these always-different
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.03,1:58:05.25,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Himawarigumi shows again.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.27,1:58:07.92,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So then—last into the next song…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.99,1:58:08.82,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,The last…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.89,1:58:09.98,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Next is…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.05,1:58:11.01,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Next is…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.71,1:58:12.36,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.43,1:58:15.59,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,That happens sometimes too.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.66,1:58:19.63,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Next is the last song, but
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.70,1:58:20.22,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,everyone —
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.78,1:58:22.36,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,can you do a big call?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.10,1:58:25.54,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.40,1:58:27.87,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,We'll sing with all our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.94,1:58:28.66,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Please listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.48,1:58:30.46,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,To be continued.


; ===== outro =====
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.85,2:07:02.35,Generic,Generic,0,0,60,,One, two—the show is over!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.15,2:07:04.75,Generic,Generic,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.25,2:07:09.04,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Looks like some members talked a lot today.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.11,2:07:10.27,Generic,Generic,0,0,60,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.73,2:07:12.58,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Yuina.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.65,2:07:14.18,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,I talked a ton.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:14.25,2:07:15.00,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,You spoke!?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.07,2:07:17.07,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Ever since she grew up.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.65,2:07:19.19,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,She was chatting away, huh.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.77,2:07:20.37,Generic,Generic,0,0,60,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.73,2:07:24.10,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.42,2:07:27.43,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,For me, today was my first time doing End Roll,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.50,2:07:29.20,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,I was nervous,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.86,2:07:30.71,Generic,Yuina,0,0,60,,but I did my best.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.71,2:07:35.56,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Rinka-chan?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.63,2:07:38.62,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,For me, it was my first time doing Wagamama na Nagareboshi,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.69,2:07:40.05,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,and I got to perform it.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.13,2:07:42.60,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,Together with Yuina,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.67,2:07:44.66,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,we even did twin tails together,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.73,2:07:45.98,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,and played cute.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.05,2:07:46.82,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,Sorry—beside me,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.89,2:07:48.21,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.39,2:07:49.57,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,She was like, "Move!" — wanting me out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.65,2:07:52.56,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,My, ever since she grew up—
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.63,2:07:53.23,Generic,Generic,0,0,60,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:53.30,2:07:54.06,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,It was so fun.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.13,2:07:56.89,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Do you all invent the last lines yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.17,2:07:58.96,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,Yes, we thought of them all ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.03,2:08:00.82,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Huh, so it changes by day.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.89,2:08:01.84,Generic,Rinka,0,0,60,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.91,2:08:03.17,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,How about you, Shisho?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.95,2:08:06.65,Generic,Shisho,0,0,60,,Being called "Shisho" by the seniors is a bit awkward,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.93,2:08:10.25,Generic,Shisho,0,0,60,,More like a comeback—I ran a bit of a fever yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.61,2:08:13.44,Generic,Shisho,0,0,60,,I came back thinking it'd end normally, but then—
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.51,2:08:14.79,Generic,Shisho,0,0,60,,I just kept talking.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.23,2:08:16.14,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,You talked the most?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.21,2:08:17.44,Generic,Shisho,0,0,60,,And I was the MC, too,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.51,2:08:18.11,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,See!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.35,2:08:18.95,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,That much?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.02,2:08:20.40,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,She only said "I'm not interested."
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.43,2:08:23.40,Generic,Yuuna,0,0,60,,She really only said "I'm not interested,"
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.47,2:08:24.70,Generic,Shisho,0,0,60,,but it was fun.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.77,2:08:26.47,Generic,Shisho,0,0,60,,Because it's the Saka Agari stage,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.85,2:08:28.82,Generic,Shisho,0,0,60,,you mix with the 7th gens,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.89,2:08:30.36,Generic,Shisho,0,0,60,,and with Team KIV folks too,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:30.43,2:08:32.78,Generic,Shisho,0,0,60,,so I hope you'll all come again.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.85,2:08:33.45,Generic,Generic,0,0,60,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.81,2:08:35.61,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,It's so refreshing, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.53,2:08:38.99,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,That kick is almost too fresh,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.57,2:08:40.58,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,it's wild.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.65,2:08:43.15,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,It's a high-stimulus show.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.81,2:08:44.72,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,Alright then,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.79,2:08:46.00,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,look forward to
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.07,2:08:47.39,Generic,Host,0,0,60,,the next performance too.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.13,2:08:49.29,Generic,Generic,0,0,60,,That was fun.
